1
00:00:07,714 --> 00:00:14,494
A lot of this work is the same
visit, at the same interval, for years.

2
00:00:14,947 --> 00:00:21,709
So describe it once. What the visit is,
and which part of the business it belongs

3
00:00:21,709 --> 00:00:21,959
to.

4
00:00:23,582 --> 00:00:29,062
Then how often it comes round,
and when the first one is due.

5
00:00:29,515 --> 00:00:33,927
And when the first one falls.
Everything after it is counted from there.

6
00:00:34,384 --> 00:00:39,539
Save it, and that is the last
time anybody thinks about it.

7
00:00:39,992 --> 00:00:47,021
From here it raises the job, assigns it
and puts it on the board, on its own, for as

8
00:00:47,021 --> 00:00:49,280
long as the contract lasts.

9
00:00:49,731 --> 00:00:55,948
Next: the small parts that make a job
provable — the list, the sub-jobs, the

10
00:00:55,948 --> 00:00:56,929
photographs.

